    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol12-ch75/0004
      quote: "75011 There are four categories of RP. These consist of\n\n\n1. contributory pensions and\n\n\n2.
        non-contributory pensions.\n\n\nNote: This applies only to people whose pensionable age is before 6.4.16."
